# Security

Follow `AGENTS.md` security and secrets sections.

- Argon2id; rotating refresh; HTTP-only cookies + CSRF
- Backend answer privacy; RBAC; IDOR prevention
- Rate-limit auth endpoints; Helmet; CORS allowlist + credentials
- No Cloudinary secrets on client; signed/server uploads
- Never commit `.env` or log tokens/passwords
- No absolute-security claims
